  "description": "The all new Subrosa Simo II Frame reinvents Simone Barraco’s signature style, blending classic Simo/Noster frame heritage with modern upgrades. Featuring new colors and decals picked and designed by Simone, an ultra-custom Subrosa seat stay bridge, and now features chain adjusters, it’s built to be a fan favorite.\n\nDesigned with Simone’s preferred geometry and a balanced rear-end length that’s not too short and not too long. It’s perfect for technical riding with stability for big sends. The Simo II is more than a frame; it’s a statement of style and performance.\n\nInvestment cast brake bridge\n\nTapered seat stays\n\nIntegrated chain tensioners\n\nNeutral geometry for responsiveness and stability\n\nBest suited to street and park riding\n\nHigh-quality chromoly construction\n\nBuilt in chain tensioners\n\nStrong butted tubing",
